<description>&lt;p&gt;Al-Shabaab militants launched a probing attack on Mangai Camp in Lamu and a separate strike 40 km northwest of Kismayo, prompting a U.S. airstrike on the latter position. Djibouti peacekeepers were killed in a clash with Hawadle militias at Beledweyne airport, while Somali intelligence killed nine Al-Shabaab members in Middle Shabelle. The Somali president accused the United Arab Emirates of funding armed groups, ordered the UAE ambassador to leave and recalled Somalia's envoy from Abu Dhabi, leading to a UAE condemnation. The conflict produced 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxPdmF5V2FxNUNfQ1N4Z2RMRU1xYWYxUklnbjZEck5XQWlGRHhCTjdycFhVTExjSHFCVGhzdzlNTTFONUpKSFE5ZXdVdTBaX2R5OUdTME9fQ1AyWVpsaW9aLWxIcGg3SW9DRDlWVkw2QjFUbzF1ZEFmTjEzMmxka0NhUm15SGU4RVhJS1B4TFYxSTZqZGlUWVdFSHdaSDhhZVE2c2lzODRnTmktY3hnTVpHS2U4c2loNFhTb3BveVRYUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxQX09oeHJVMEswVHNnUXJrdXN0YW90R2d6QURxMXVOVC1HLXk1Z01HUHlRWDA2QTFuTmpUd2xPUnJWTUc1ZjAxS0VaQzhvR3V3U1V2VFhuTVRrQXRpd3E0a0tjYjRiZmNfOWhjYWwtTTkzZnZ4R2lCbXhoNEVJTjhhd0FZQlppZnR1TldCZEdBVG12cUVnSTU1OEZnb1MxOVhZUzJ0ZEwtVjRIQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxNRVlZb21WekU5S2lTVWdKeWVNQmduSElhUnZkTExjcG5lNWVZVTVVcW5Qam1NWkFSSDhtQUpuVG5wQnZISWxvcEM0c2c1Q3YtX3pRZkZadlpBelBJVTd3S2tETFIzVUlpLWJHVi1HcThDT3YwSTVXaS1HXzU3SjFEWkFEWFhXSV9wYzN4UEYwbHZ4QURKVnlja0FzclJyeHhySUNFaW1jM3d6QThhZUZTVGNmUThSWnk4dWpCdUVLNXlTZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxNTjVIMXZ5LVBaNnJval8xQ3dlcGFaS1BfblpvcXppQVRPdFo3R05x